# Gitea recipe: permission-normaliser exceptions (slice 6B
# flag 1). Read by the app container's init after its uniform
# pass, and applied by onionhost-recipe itself after an apply;
# format:
#   <octal mode> <path relative to the app-data volume>
# app.ini holds the instance's secret keys (session and
# internal tokens): the uniform pass would leave it
# group-shared at 0664; the recipe keeps it at 0660. The
# first-boot env copy holds the administrator password in
# plaintext for the one boot it exists in; it is shredded by
# the first-boot step itself, and pinned restrictive here for
# the hours it may wait for a publish retry.
0660 native/custom/conf/app.ini
0400 native/.recipe-admin.env
